  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Ghostrick Spunkie",
      "effect": "Cannot be Normal Summoned, unless you control a \"Ghostrick\" monster. When your opponent activates a monster effect on the field (Quick Effect): You can Special Summon this card from your hand in face-down Defense Position, and if you do, place 1 \"Ghostrick\" Field Spell or \"Ghostrick\" Continuous Trap from your hand or Deck face-up on your field, then if your opponent has 5 or more cards in their GY, you can Special Summon 1 monster from your hand in face-down Defense Position. Once per turn: You can change this card to face-down Defense Position.",
      "official": false
    },
